cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software with its exact version, commit and configuration hash."
type: software
title: "HoloVirtualBattery / HoloEnergy: an external electro-thermal energy wrapper for HoloOcean"
authors:
  - family-names: Bedei
    given-names: Andrea
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-06
repository-code: "https://github.com/AndreaBedei1/HoloVirtualBattery"
url: "https://github.com/AndreaBedei1/HoloVirtualBattery"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Configurable discharge-only L0 and Rint L1 energy models, lumped battery
  thermal dynamics, manufacturer T200 curves, stateful payload loads and
  nonlinear action derating for a single direct-thruster HoloOcean agent.
  Includes reproducible calibration and held-out evaluation tooling.
  Software and native simulator checks do not establish physical BlueROV2 validation.
keywords:
  - marine robotics
  - battery modelling
  - electro-thermal simulation
  - HoloOcean
  - reproducibility
